    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "3. Prosecution story, in brief, is that at the time of the incident, the prosecutrix aged around 15 years Dinesh vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 18 August, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/190230483/\n1 and 8 months.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1219,
      "end": 1453,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Dinesh vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 1326,
          "end": 1363
        },
        {
          "text": "18 August, 2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1367,
          "end": 1382
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.21408426761627197
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "The applicant/accused is real uncle of the prosecutrix.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1454,
      "end": 1509,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.25311362743377686
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "On 15.03.2023, at around 02:00 PM, the prosecutrix was at her home.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1510,
      "end": 1577,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "15.03.2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1513,
          "end": 1523
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2661104202270508
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "After being called by the applicant, the prosecutrix went to his home.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1578,
      "end": 1648,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.28742918372154236
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "At that time, the applicant was alone in his house.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1649,
      "end": 1700,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.30146855115890503
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "When the prosecutrix entered his house, the applicant closed the door from inside.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1701,
      "end": 1783,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3074186444282532
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "Thereafter, he committed rape upon her.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1784,
      "end": 1823,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.32334104180336
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "She tried to cry for help, then he closed her mouth.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1824,
      "end": 1876,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.270215779542923
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "The applicant threatened that if she told about the incident to anyone, he will kill her and her parents.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1877,
      "end": 1982,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2556544244289398
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "Therefore, she did not tell about the incident to anyone.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1983,
      "end": 2040,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2988230884075165
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "On 16.05.2023, the prosecutrix was weeping, her mother asked her then she narrated the incident to her mother.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2041,
      "end": 2151,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "16.05.2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2044,
          "end": 2054
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.29516637325286865
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "Matter was reported on 17.05.2023 at P/S Bilpankh, Ratlam against the applicant by mother of prosecutrix.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2152,
      "end": 2257,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "17.05.2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2175,
          "end": 2185
        },
        {
          "text": "P/S Bilpankh, Ratlam",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 2189,
          "end": 2209
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.25123393535614014
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "During examination, it was found that there was 10 weeks foetus in her uterus.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2258,
      "end": 2336,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.27170225977897644
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "4. Learned counsel for the applicant/accused submits that the applicant has not committed the offence and has falsely been implicated in the case.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2337,
      "end": 2484,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2547934651374817
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "There is delay of 2 months in lodging of FIR and the same has not been explained by the prosecution.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2485,
      "end": 2585,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2447432428598404
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "Therefore, it is clear that a concocted case has been made out against the applicant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2586,
      "end": 2671,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.24836814403533936
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 27,
      "text": "Case of prosecution is also not supported by the medical report.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2672,
      "end": 2736,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2209215760231018
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 28,
      "text": "After the incident, on 30.05.2023, wife of the applicant has submitted a detailed complaint (Annexed at page 11) to SP, Ratlam, narrating in detail about the alleged incident and the factual situation of the same as there was one Lakhan, who had relationship with the prosecutrix and just in order to falsely implicate the applicant, this case has been foisted upon the applicant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2737,
      "end": 3117,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "30.05.2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2760,
          "end": 2770
        },
        {
          "text": "Ratlam",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 2857,
          "end": 2863
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakhan",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 2967,
          "end": 2973
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2340795248746872
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 29,
      "text": "Applicant is in custody since 18.05.2023.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 3118,
      "end": 3159,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "18.05.2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3148,
          "end": 3158
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.24399322271347046
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 30,
      "text": "After completion of investigation, charge-sheet has been filed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3160,
      "end": 3223,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20065459609031677
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 31,
      "text": "Conclusion of the trial will take considerable long time for its disposal.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 3224,
      "end": 3298,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.193776935338974
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 32,
      "text": "Therefore, it is prayed that the applicant be released on bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3299,
      "end": 3362,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.18959294259548187
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 33,
      "text": "5. On other hand, learned Panel Lawyer appearing on behalf of State/non- applicant has objected the prayer and submitted that there is no reason to show that the prosecutrix has falsely implicated the applicant in the crime.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3364,
      "end": 3588,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.21037058532238007
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 34,
      "text": "The prosecutrix is a minor (below 16 years).",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3589,
      "end": 3633,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3254767656326294
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 35,
      "text": "The applicant is her real uncle.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3634,
      "end": 3666,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.37447991967201233
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 36,
      "text": "Therefore, delay of 2 months in lodging the FIR is not material.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3667,
      "end": 3731,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.39000824093818665
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 37,
      "text": "Alleged complaint filed by wife of the applicant to SP, Ratlam after 30 days of lodging of the FIR is afterthought.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 3732,
      "end": 3847,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Ratlam",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 3788,
          "end": 3794
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.36631837487220764
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 38,
      "text": "The offence is serious in nature.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 3848,
      "end": 3881,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.369868665933609
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 39,
      "text": "Therefore, applicant is not entitled for bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 3882,
      "end": 3928,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.40298739075660706
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 40,
      "text": "6. Having heard learned counsels for the parties, perused the case-diary also considering the facts and circumstances of the case, in view of this Court, at this stage, it is not a fit case to grant bail to the applicant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 3929,
      "end": 4151,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 41,
      "text": "Resultantly, application for bail is rejected.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 4152,
      "end": 4198,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.32621094584465027
    },
